  "description": "Wedding planner \"Sae-ah,\" a pushover that gives me a proxy bride of my ex-husband. One day, Ji-hyuk, a man who goes straight like a bulldozer, appeared to such a new son at first sight. The problem is that he was a love master with fiery push skills!\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5024024)  \n*Translations: [Japanese](https://booklive.jp/product/index/title_id/1274124/) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=792725), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8287130), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746035975), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/MilldanguiYojung), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/push_pull_fairy), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080681), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70216724) \n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/playing-hard-to-get/list?title_no=4553), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/playing-hard-to-get/list?title_no=5126), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003009)",
